{"stdout": "true\nfalse\ntrue\nA\nB\nC\n1.5\n2.5\n3.5\n1.5\n2.5\n3.5\n1000\n-2000\n3000\n100000\n-200000\n300000\n10000000000\n-20000000000\n30000000000\n1\n-2\n3\nhello\nworld\n!\ntrue 1 one\nfalse 2 two\ntrue 3 three\n1000\n2000\n3000\n100000\n200000\n300000\n10000000000\n20000000000\n30000000000\n1\n2\n3\n"}
